ion, logic or reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">+ You can play each pack separately or mix and match to unique game configurations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">+ Some packs inspired by classic card and board games (Hanafuda, crazy8, Old maid).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">+ Each card pack comes with its own graphical style creating a rich and varied.</p>","developers":["GrosChevaux"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3264960","name":"Cardburners"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339150/0371b626717621e9f0d8332df01912dcdad87b62/header.jpg?t=1748620292","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOs, Ubuntu or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 350 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOs, Ubuntu or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 350 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.12<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 350 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.12<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 350 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257130963,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130963/movie480.mp4?t=1748348257","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstati